  "_note": "Initial CMMS configuration. Written ONCE to the ThingsBoard asset 'Maintenance Settings' (attribute cmms_settings) by period_reports/deploy_dashboard.py when it does not exist yet. After that the values live in ThingsBoard and are edited on the dashboard (Maintenance Management > Settings); the code contains no defaults.",
